{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/B3G---Skyline-Belgrade-Kneza-Milosa-88-Belgrade/Vice-President--Applied-AI---Data-Science---Investment---Trading-Compliance_R265376","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/B3G---Skyline-Belgrade-Kneza-Milosa-88-Belgrade/Vice-President--Applied-AI---Data-Science---Investment---Trading-Compliance_R265376","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"070477489c334f062366ca7005fafb7839b361ff4ff26626d0ad04adc8cf5f50","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Applied AI & Data Science, Vice President","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/B3G---Skyline-Belgrade-Kneza-Milosa-88-Belgrade/Vice-President--Applied-AI---Data-Science---Investment---Trading-Compliance_R265376","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/B3G---Skyline-Belgrade-Kneza-Milosa-88-Belgrade/Vice-President--Applied-AI---Data-Science---Investment---Trading-Compliance_R265376","locations":[{"label":"B3G - Skyline Belgrade, Kneza Milosa 88, Belgrade"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R265376","internal_job_id":"18bd4fe44f091001876f0e97a38d0000","first_published_at":"2026-08-17","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nBlackRock’s Investment & Trading Compliance engineering organization is reimagining how compliance professionals interact with regulations, investment guidelines, and business processes through artificial intelligence.\n\nWe are seeking a Vice President, Applied AI & Data Science to help define and deliver the next generation of AI-powered compliance capabilities across the Aladdin platform. This role combines expertise in machine learning, generative AI, information retrieval, and software product development to create intelligent solutions that transform how compliance workflows are executed. The role also requires strong product engineering experience and the ability to apply modern, AI-enabled development practices to deliver production-grade solutions.\n\nYou will work closely with product managers, software engineers, compliance specialists, AI researchers, and business stakeholders to build and scale AI solutions that automate complex workflows, accelerate knowledge discovery, improve decision-making, and enhance operational efficiency across global compliance functions.\n\nThis is a highly impactful role focused on bringing emerging AI technologies into production and delivering measurable outcomes for clients and internal users.\n\nAbout the team\n\nThe Investment & Trading Compliance engineering team develops technology that helps investment professionals and compliance teams manage regulatory obligations and investment restrictions across global markets.\nOur mission is to leverage artificial intelligence to transform compliance from reactive processes into intelligent, proactive, and scalable experiences.\n\nKey areas of focus include:\n- Agentic compliance workflows\n\n- AI-powered compliance assistants and copilots\n\n- Semantic search and knowledge retrieval\n\n- Large language models and reasoning systems\n\n- Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)\n\n- Compliance knowledge graphs and rule intelligence\n\n- AI-driven workflow automation\n\n- Evaluation and governance of AI systems\n\n- Enterprise AI platforms within Aladdin\n\nWhat You’ll Do\n\nDrive AI Innovation\n- Lead the design, development, and deployment of advanced AI solutions that address complex compliance and regulatory challenges.\n\n- Identify opportunities where AI can transform existing processes and unlock new capabilities for compliance professionals.\n\n- Shape the long-term AI strategy and roadmap for Investment & Trading Compliance.\n\nBuild Intelligent AI Systems\n- Design and implement solutions leveraging large language models, agentic frameworks, retrieval systems, and enterprise knowledge platforms.\n\n- Develop approaches for semantic search, intelligent document retrieval, workflow orchestration, and reasoning over compliance knowledge.\n\n- Partner with engineering teams to deliver highly scalable, production-grade AI services.\n\n- Apply modern product engineering practices across the software and product development lifecycle, including the use of AI to accelerate design exploration, prototyping, implementation, testing, code review, and documentation.\n\n- Articulate architectural trade-offs and design options, including their impact on scalability, resilience, cost, and delivery velocity.\n\nAdvance Applied AI Research\n- Evaluate emerging trends and technologies across generative AI, agentic architectures, retrieval systems, and foundation models.\n\n- Establish experimentation frameworks to validate new approaches and technologies.\n\n- Collaborate with internal AI research teams to translate innovative concepts into real-world business solutions.\n\nOwn AI Quality and Governance\n- Define evaluation methodologies, success metrics, benchmarking strategies, and monitoring frameworks for AI solutions.\n\n- Drive continuous improvement through model evaluation, user feedback, and operational telemetry.\n\n- Ensure AI solutions meet BlackRock standards for responsible AI, transparency, security, and reliability.\n\nPartner Across the Firm\n- Collaborate with engineering, product, legal, compliance, and AI platform teams to deliver business value through AI.\n\n- Communicate complex technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.\n\n- Influence senior stakeholders and drive alignment across multiple organizations.\n\nMentor and Lead\n- Provide technical leadership and mentorship to data scientists, machine learning engineers, and software engineers.\n\n- Promote best practices in experimentation, evaluation, AI engineering, and product development.\n\n- Foster a culture of innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.\n\nAbout you\n- Advanced degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Machine Learning, Statistics, Mathematics, Engineering, or a related quantitative discipline.\n\n- Significant experience developing and deploying machine learning or AI solutions in production environments.\n\n- Demonstrated expertise applying data science and AI techniques to solve complex business problems.\n\n- Strong programming skills in Python and experience working within modern software development environments.\n\n- Experience partnering with software engineering teams to operationalize AI solutions at enterprise scale.\n\n- Experience applying modern product engineering practices to deliver scalable, production-grade solutions.\n\n- Familiarity with AI-enabled SDLC and PDLC practices, including specification-driven development, AI-assisted development, testing, code review, and documentation.\n\n- Experience with modern AI development tools such as Devin, Windsurf, Claude Code, or similar.\n\n- Ability to articulate architectural trade-offs and design options, including impacts on scalability, resilience, cost, and delivery velocity.\n\n- Familiarity with API design principles, event-driven architecture, and quality practices such as test-driven and behavior-driven development.\n\n- Ability to influence technical strategy and drive initiatives across organizational boundaries.\n\n- Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.\n\nPreferred\n- Experience with large language models (LLMs), generative AI, and agentic AI systems.\n\n- Experience building semantic search, retrieval, recommendation, or knowledge discovery platforms.\n\n- Familiarity with embeddings, vector search, ranking systems, and information retrieval methodologies.\n\n- Experience establishing AI evaluation frameworks and model quality metrics.\n\n- Understanding of AI governance, model risk management, and responsible AI principles.\n\n- Experience in financial services, regulatory technology, compliance technology, or enterprise SaaS platforms.\n\n- Experience with cloud-native AI architectures and modern ML platforms.\n\nTechnologies We Use\nExamples of technologies and platforms used by the team include:\n- Python\n\n- SQL\n\n- Azure AI Services\n\n- OpenAI and enterprise foundation models\n\n- Retrieval and search platforms\n\n- Embedding and vector search technologies\n\n- Machine learning frameworks\n\n- Knowledge management systems\n\n- Distributed cloud platforms\n\n- Observability and AI evaluation tooling\n\n- API and event-driven architectures\n\n- AI-assisted software development tools\n\n- Automated testing and continuous delivery practices\n\nOur Impact\n\nOur team is building the foundation for the future of compliance technology at BlackRock. We are creating intelligent systems that help users search vast compliance knowledge bases, automate complex workflows, reason across regulations and investment restrictions, and deliver AI-powered experiences directly within Aladdin.\n\nThe successful candidate will play a critical role in defining how AI transforms compliance operations for BlackRock and our clients globally.\n\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of employee benefits including: retirement investment and tools designed to help you in building a sound financial future; access to education reimbursement; comprehensive resources to support your physical health and emotional well-being; family support programs; and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected characteristics at law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><span>BlackRock’s Investment &amp; Trading Compliance engineering organization is reimagining how compliance professionals interact with regulations, investment guidelines, and business processes through artificial intelligence.</span></p><p></p><p><span>We are seeking a Vice President, Applied AI &amp; Data Science to help define and deliver the next generation of AI-powered compliance capabilities across the Aladdin platform. This role combines expertise in machine learning, generative AI, information retrieval, and software product development to create intelligent solutions that transform how compliance workflows are executed. The role also requires strong product engineering experience and the ability to apply modern, AI-enabled development practices to deliver production-grade solutions.</span></p><p></p><p><span>You will work closely with product managers, software engineers, compliance specialists, AI researchers, and business stakeholders to build and scale AI solutions that automate complex workflows, accelerate knowledge discovery, improve decision-making, and enhance operational efficiency across global compliance functions.</span></p><p></p><p><span>This is a highly impactful role focused on bringing emerging AI technologies into production and delivering measurable outcomes for clients and internal users.</span></p><p></p><p><span>About the team</span></p><p></p><p><span>The Investment &amp; Trading Compliance engineering team develops technology that helps investment professionals and compliance teams manage regulatory obligations and investment restrictions across global markets.</span></p><p><span>Our mission is to leverage artificial intelligence to transform compliance from reactive processes into intelligent, proactive, and scalable experiences.</span></p><p></p><p><span>Key areas of focus include:</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Agentic compliance workflows</span></p></li><li><p><span>AI-powered compliance assistants and copilots</span></p></li><li><p><span>Semantic search and knowledge retrieval</span></p></li><li><p><span>Large language models and reasoning systems</span></p></li><li><p><span>Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG)</span></p></li><li><p><span>Compliance knowledge graphs and rule intelligence</span></p></li><li><p><span>AI-driven workflow automation</span></p></li><li><p><span>Evaluation and governance of AI systems</span></p></li><li><p><span>Enterprise AI platforms within Aladdin</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>What You’ll Do</span></p><p></p><p><span>Drive AI Innovation</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Lead the design, development, and deployment of advanced AI solutions that address complex compliance and regulatory challenges.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Identify opportunities where AI can transform existing processes and unlock new capabilities for compliance professionals.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Shape the long-term AI strategy and roadmap for Investment &amp; Trading Compliance.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>Build Intelligent AI Systems</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Design and implement solutions leveraging large language models, agentic frameworks, retrieval systems, and enterprise knowledge platforms.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Develop approaches for semantic search, intelligent document retrieval, workflow orchestration, and reasoning over compliance knowledge.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Partner with engineering teams to deliver highly scalable, production-grade AI services.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Apply modern product engineering practices across the software and product development lifecycle, including the use of AI to accelerate design exploration, prototyping, implementation, testing, code review, and documentation.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Articulate architectural trade-offs and design options, including their impact on scalability, resilience, cost, and delivery velocity.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>Advance Applied AI Research</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Evaluate emerging trends and technologies across generative AI, agentic architectures, retrieval systems, and foundation models.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Establish experimentation frameworks to validate new approaches and technologies.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Collaborate with internal AI research teams to translate innovative concepts into real-world business solutions.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>Own AI Quality and Governance</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Define evaluation methodologies, success metrics, benchmarking strategies, and monitoring frameworks for AI solutions.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Drive continuous improvement through model evaluation, user feedback, and operational telemetry.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Ensure AI solutions meet BlackRock standards for responsible AI, transparency, security, and reliability.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>Partner Across the Firm</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Collaborate with engineering, product, legal, compliance, and AI platform teams to deliver business value through AI.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Communicate complex technical concepts clearly to both technical and non-technical audiences.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Influence senior stakeholders and drive alignment across multiple organizations.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>Mentor and Lead</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Provide technical leadership and mentorship to data scientists, machine learning engineers, and software engineers.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Promote best practices in experimentation, evaluation, AI engineering, and product development.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Foster a culture of innovation, collaboration, and continuous learning.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p>About you</p><ul><li><p><span>Advanced degree in Computer Science, Data Science, Machine Learning, Statistics, Mathematics, Engineering, or a related quantitative discipline.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Significant experience developing and deploying machine learning or AI solutions in production environments.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Demonstrated expertise applying data science and AI techniques to solve complex business problems.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Strong programming skills in Python and experience working within modern software development environments.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Experience partnering with software engineering teams to operationalize AI solutions at enterprise scale.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Experience applying modern product engineering practices to deliver scalable, production-grade solutions.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Familiarity with AI-enabled SDLC and PDLC practices, including specification-driven development, AI-assisted development, testing, code review, and documentation.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Experience with modern AI development tools such as Devin, Windsurf, Claude Code, or similar.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Ability to articulate architectural trade-offs and design options, including impacts on scalability, resilience, cost, and delivery velocity.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Familiarity with API design principles, event-driven architecture, and quality practices such as test-driven and behavior-driven development.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Ability to influence technical strategy and drive initiatives across organizational boundaries.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>Preferred</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Experience with large language models (LLMs), generative AI, and agentic AI systems.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Experience building semantic search, retrieval, recommendation, or knowledge discovery platforms.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Familiarity with embeddings, vector search, ranking systems, and information retrieval methodologies.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Experience establishing AI evaluation frameworks and model quality metrics.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Understanding of AI governance, model risk management, and responsible AI principles.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Experience in financial services, regulatory technology, compliance technology, or enterprise SaaS platforms.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Experience with cloud-native AI architectures and modern ML platforms.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>Technologies We Use</span></p><p><span>Examples of technologies and platforms used by the team include:</span></p><ul><li><p><span>Python</span></p></li><li><p><span>SQL</span></p></li><li><p><span>Azure AI Services</span></p></li><li><p><span>OpenAI and enterprise foundation models</span></p></li><li><p><span>Retrieval and search platforms</span></p></li><li><p><span>Embedding and vector search technologies</span></p></li><li><p><span>Machine learning frameworks</span></p></li><li><p><span>Knowledge management systems</span></p></li><li><p><span>Distributed cloud platforms</span></p></li><li><p><span>Observability and AI evaluation tooling</span></p></li><li><p><span>API and event-driven architectures</span></p></li><li><p><span>AI-assisted software development tools</span></p></li><li><p><span>Automated testing and continuous delivery practices</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span>Our Impact</span></p><p></p><p><span>Our team is building the foundation for the future of compliance technology at BlackRock. We are creating intelligent systems that help users search vast compliance knowledge bases, automate complex workflows, reason across regulations and investment restrictions, and deliver AI-powered experiences directly within Aladdin.</span></p><p></p><p><span>The successful candidate will play a critical role in defining how AI transforms compliance operations for BlackRock and our clients globally.</span></p><p></p><p><b>Our benefits</b></p><p></p><p>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of employee benefits including: retirement investment and tools designed to help you in building a sound financial future; access to education reimbursement; comprehensive resources to support your physical health and emotional well-being; family support programs; and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b><br />Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.<br /></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40LifeatBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858854986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;4m94z87I%2F5Y33edGFrw7b8oEwUqEPoMi8aRSP5Grc2E%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>YouTube</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858881999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JN9zBoi1f6dr35BovPmwulYT68B%2F1QHg3gR%2Bmg7TT14%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>X</u></span></a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40blackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858903740%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;aHv7vpILkjI1mNFebVSda3a0HnLsNeTO4nisrrZIFrc%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>TikTok</u></span></a>.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected characteristics at law.</span></p>","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"Serbia","id":"b3f8697442124d6aaeb752a13c1e8491"},"posted_on":"Posted 7 Days Ago"},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T05:34:36.556Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":4,"level":"executive","term":null,"tracks":["ai-ml"],"role_matches":["Applied AI"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["AI","Applied"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["finance-ai"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/Atlanta-GA/Artificial-Intelligence---Machine-Learning-Engineer--Vice-President---AI-Labas_R265980","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/Atlanta-GA/Artificial-Intelligence---Machine-Learning-Engineer--Vice-President---AI-Labas_R265980","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"9f44cc1785fee3b083354fcb92031d0956a7681e267acdae3bd682b40853baa9","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning Engineer, Vice President - AI Labs","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Atlanta-GA/Artificial-Intelligence---Machine-Learning-Engineer--Vice-President---AI-Labas_R265980","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Atlanta-GA/Artificial-Intelligence---Machine-Learning-Engineer--Vice-President---AI-Labas_R265980","locations":[{"label":"Atlanta, GA"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R265980","internal_job_id":"c0e67d5a1c35100077e195e7b8ed0000","first_published_at":"2026-08-17","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nDevelops and deploys machine learning models and AI solutions that solve business problems and enhance products. Conducts data exploration, feature engineering, model training, evaluation, and deployment. Implements MLOps practices to productionize and monitor models in production environments. Collaborates with data scientists, engineers, and business stakeholders. Optimizes model performance, scalability, and reliability. Stays current on AI/ML advancements and techniques.\n\nRelevant Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities:\n\n• Machine learning frameworks (TensorFlow, PyTorch, scikit-learn)\n• Programming languages (Python, R, Java)\n• Deep learning, NLP, computer vision techniques\n• Cloud ML platforms (AWS SageMaker, Azure ML, Vertex AI)\n• MLOps tools and practices\n• Statistical analysis and experimentation\nFor Atlanta, GA Only the salary range for this position is USD$170,000.00 - USD$220,000.00 . Additionally, employees are eligible for an annual discretionary bonus, and benefits including healthcare, leave benefits, and retirement benefits. BlackRock operates a pay-for-performance compensation philosophy and your total compensation may vary based on role, location, and firm, department and individual performance.\n\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity to all applicants and existing employees, and we evaluate qualified applicants without regard to race, creed, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy and gender identity/expression), sexual orientation, age, ancestry, physical or mental disability, marital status, political affiliation, religion, citizenship status, genetic information, veteran status, or any other basis protected under applicable federal, state, or local law.  View the  EEOC’s Know Your Rights poster and its supplement  and the  pay transparency statement .\n \nBlackRock is committed to full inclusion of all qualified individuals and to providing reasonable accommodations or job modifications for individuals with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation/adjustments are needed throughout the employment process, please email Disability.Assistance@blackrock.com . All requests are treated in line with our  privacy policy .\n\nBlackRock will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records in a manner consistent with the requirements of the law, including any applicable fair chance law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p>Develops and deploys machine learning models and AI solutions that solve business problems and enhance products. Conducts data exploration, feature engineering, model training, evaluation, and deployment. Implements MLOps practices to productionize and monitor models in production environments. Collaborates with data scientists, engineers, and business stakeholders. Optimizes model performance, scalability, and reliability. Stays current on AI/ML advancements and techniques.\n\nRelevant Knowledge, Skills, and Abilities:\n\n• Machine learning frameworks (TensorFlow, PyTorch, scikit-learn)\n• Programming languages (Python, R, Java)\n• Deep learning, NLP, computer vision techniques\n• Cloud ML platforms (AWS SageMaker, Azure ML, Vertex AI)\n• MLOps tools and practices\n• Statistical analysis and experimentation&amp;#xa;For Atlanta, GA Only the salary range for this position is USD$170,000.00 - USD$220,000.00 . Additionally, employees are eligible for an annual discretionary bonus, and benefits including healthcare, leave benefits, and retirement benefits. BlackRock operates a pay-for-performance compensation philosophy and your total compensation may vary based on role, location, and firm, department and individual performance.&amp;#xa;<p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b><span>Our benefits</span></b><br /><br /><span>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b><br />Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.<br /></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40LifeatBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858854986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;4m94z87I%2F5Y33edGFrw7b8oEwUqEPoMi8aRSP5Grc2E%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>YouTube</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858881999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JN9zBoi1f6dr35BovPmwulYT68B%2F1QHg3gR%2Bmg7TT14%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>X</u></span></a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40blackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858903740%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;aHv7vpILkjI1mNFebVSda3a0HnLsNeTO4nisrrZIFrc%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>TikTok</u></span></a>.<br /></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity to all applicants and existing employees, and we evaluate qualified applicants without regard to race, creed, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy and gender <span><span><span><span><span class=\"WOR0\">identity/expression),</span></span></span></span></span> sexual orientation, age, ancestry, physical or mental disability, marital status, political affiliation, religion, citizenship status, genetic information, veteran status, or any other basis protected under applicable federal, state, or local law. <b>View the </b></span><b><a href=\"https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">EEOC’s Know Your Rights poster and its supplement</a></b><span><b> and the </b></span><b><a href=\"https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">pay transparency statement</a><span>.</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"><span> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is committed to full inclusion of all qualified individuals and to providing reasonable accommodations or job modifications for individuals with disabilities. If reasonable <span><span><span><span><span class=\"WOR0\">accommodation/adjustments</span></span></span></span></span> are needed throughout the employment process, please email <a href=\"mailto:Disability.Assistance&#64;blackrock.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span class=\"WOR0\">Disability.Assistance&#64;blackrock.com</span></span></span></span></span></a>. All requests are treated in line with our <a href=\"http://www.blackrock.com/corporate/compliance/privacy-policy#recruitment-privacy-notice\" target=\"_blank\"><b>privacy policy</b></a><a href=\"http://www.blackrock.com/corporate/compliance/privacy-policy#recruitment-privacy-notice\" target=\"_blank\">.</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p>BlackRock will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records in a manner consistent with the requirements of the law, including any applicable fair chance law.","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"United States of America","id":"bc33aa3152ec42d4995f4791a106ed09"},"posted_on":"Posted 7 Days Ago"},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T05:34:36.556Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":6,"level":"executive","term":null,"tracks":["ai-ml"],"role_matches":["Machine Learning","Artificial Intelligence"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["AI","Machine Learning"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["finance-ai"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/New-York-NY/Artificial-Intelligence---Machine-Learning-Engineer--Vice-President---AI-Labs_R265982","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/New-York-NY/Artificial-Intelligence---Machine-Learning-Engineer--Vice-President---AI-Labs_R265982","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"cedc366eb53a6210cadfa6e6b2a165590ae00d491ef6e85e1b5e5b7c4872ec08","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning Engineer, Vice President - AI Labs","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/New-York-NY/Artificial-Intelligence---Machine-Learning-Engineer--Vice-President---AI-Labs_R265982","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/New-York-NY/Artificial-Intelligence---Machine-Learning-Engineer--Vice-President---AI-Labs_R265982","locations":[{"label":"New York, NY"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R265982","internal_job_id":"9de45a805b591001a4e522c8053e0000","first_published_at":"2026-08-20","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nAI Labs Overview  \n\nFor more than three decades, BlackRock has combined world-class talent and technology to redefine what's possible in asset management. Today, AI is reshaping every aspect of our industry, from investments and client experiences to operations, risk management, and product innovation. BlackRock AI Labs sits at the center of that transformation.\n\nAI Labs is BlackRock's advanced AI science and engineering organization. We partner with teams across the firm to solve some of the most complex and consequential challenges in financial services, applying generative AI, machine learning, optimization, and statistics to deliver measurable business impact. Our mission is simple but ambitious: combine human and machine intelligence to revolutionize asset management.\n\nWhat sets AI Labs apart is our ability to move from idea to impact. We are not a research lab detached from the business, nor are we a traditional software engineering organization. We are a hybrid team of scientists and engineers who build solutions that run at scale in production environments and create capacity for our business partners. From AI-powered investment insights and risk management solutions to next-generation agentic workflows and enterprise AI platforms, our work is helping to shape the future of BlackRock.\n\nOur teams work on some of the firm's highest priority strategic initiatives, including large-scale generative AI systems, intelligent agents, predictive analytics, optimization engines, operational risk solutions, and AI platforms that accelerate innovation across BlackRock. We help define best practices, establish technical standards, and enable teams throughout the organization to adopt AI safely, effectively, and at scale.\n\nAI Labs has offices in New York, Edinburgh, Atlanta, San Francisco and Seattle.\nWe are looking for candidates with unique backgrounds and diverse skill sets with fresh perspectives to accelerate and amplify our efforts to make an impact at BlackRock.\n\nIn this role, you can expect to:\n- Provide technical leadership, set architectural direction, and drive key design decisions across multidisciplinary teams.\n- Design, build, and operate production AI/ML systems across areas such as generative AI, intelligent agents, predictive modeling, and optimization.\n- Develop reusable AI platforms, services, and infrastructure that accelerate experimentation, deployment, monitoring, and adoption across the firm.\n- Translate emerging AI capabilities into robust, scalable solutions that deliver measurable business impact.\n- Define evaluation, testing, and observability approaches for AI systems, including non-deterministic and agentic applications.\n- Optimize AI systems and workloads for latency, throughput, compute efficiency, reliability, security, and cost.\n- Partner with business, engineering, data, risk, and control teams to take solutions from concept through production deployment and ongoing operation.\n- Establish engineering standards, mentor engineers, and influence technical strategy across teams.\n\nThe minimum requirements for this position are:\n- 8+ years of software engineering experience, including significant experience designing, building, and operating complex production systems.\n- 4+ years of experience building and deploying AI/ML, optimization, or other model-driven applications in production.\n- Strong proficiency in Python and a track record of developing maintainable, well-tested production software.\n- Strong SQL skills and experience working with data-intensive applications and large-scale datasets.\n- Experience designing and building APIs, services, data pipelines, or distributed systems that support AI/ML applications.\n- Experience with containerization and orchestration technologies, such as Docker and Kubernetes.\n- Demonstrated ability to lead complex technical solutions from architecture and design through production deployment, operation, and continuous improvement.\n- Strong problem-solving, collaboration, and communication skills, with the ability to influence technical decisions across multidisciplinary teams.\n\nAdditional knowledge and experience we value includes:\n- Experience collaborating with research teams in fast-moving environments, ideating quickly on research prototypes.\n- Generative AI, large language models, AI agents, and architectures for production AI systems.\n- Evaluation, experimentation, observability, debugging, and testing approaches for AI/ML systems, including non-deterministic and agentic applications.\n- Machine learning and optimization frameworks such as PyTorch, TensorFlow, or JAX.\n- Distributed systems, cloud infrastructure, model serving, orchestration, data pipelines, and API design.\n- Performance optimization across latency, throughput, compute utilization, reliability, scalability, and cost.\n- Responsible AI, security, governance, and controls in enterprise or regulated environments.\n- Experience with a systems- or performance-oriented programming language such as Rust, C++, C, Go, or Zig.\n- Experience in financial services or another regulated industry.\n\nFor New York, NY Only the salary range for this position is USD$190,000.00 - USD$240,000.00 . Additionally, employees are eligible for an annual discretionary bonus, and benefits including healthcare, leave benefits, and retirement benefits. BlackRock operates a pay-for-performance compensation philosophy and your total compensation may vary based on role, location, and firm, department and individual performance.\n\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity to all applicants and existing employees, and we evaluate qualified applicants without regard to race, creed, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy and gender identity/expression), sexual orientation, age, ancestry, physical or mental disability, marital status, political affiliation, religion, citizenship status, genetic information, veteran status, or any other basis protected under applicable federal, state, or local law.  View the  EEOC’s Know Your Rights poster and its supplement  and the  pay transparency statement .\n \nBlackRock is committed to full inclusion of all qualified individuals and to providing reasonable accommodations or job modifications for individuals with disabilities. If reasonable accommodation/adjustments are needed throughout the employment process, please email Disability.Assistance@blackrock.com . All requests are treated in line with our  privacy policy .\n\nBlackRock will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records in a manner consistent with the requirements of the law, including any applicable fair chance law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b>AI Labs Overview</b> </p><p></p><p>For more than three decades, BlackRock has combined world-class talent and technology to redefine what&#39;s possible in asset management. Today, AI is reshaping every aspect of our industry, from investments and client experiences to operations, risk management, and product innovation. BlackRock AI Labs sits at the center of that transformation.</p><p></p><p>AI Labs is BlackRock&#39;s advanced AI science and engineering organization. We partner with teams across the firm to solve some of the most complex and consequential challenges in financial services, applying generative AI, machine learning, optimization, and statistics to deliver measurable business impact. Our mission is simple but ambitious: combine human and machine intelligence to revolutionize asset management.</p><p></p><p>What sets AI Labs apart is our ability to move from idea to impact. We are not a research lab detached from the business, nor are we a traditional software engineering organization. We are a hybrid team of scientists and engineers who build solutions that run at scale in production environments and create capacity for our business partners. From AI-powered investment insights and risk management solutions to next-generation agentic workflows and enterprise AI platforms, our work is helping to shape the future of BlackRock.</p><p></p><p>Our teams work on some of the firm&#39;s highest priority strategic initiatives, including large-scale generative AI systems, intelligent agents, predictive analytics, optimization engines, operational risk solutions, and AI platforms that accelerate innovation across BlackRock. We help define best practices, establish technical standards, and enable teams throughout the organization to adopt AI safely, effectively, and at scale.</p><p></p><p>AI Labs has offices in New York, Edinburgh, Atlanta, San Francisco and Seattle.</p><p>We are looking for candidates with unique backgrounds and diverse skill sets with fresh perspectives to accelerate and amplify our efforts to make an impact at BlackRock.</p><p></p><p><b>In this role, you can expect to:</b></p><ul><li>Provide technical leadership, set architectural direction, and drive key design decisions across multidisciplinary teams.</li><li>Design, build, and operate production AI/ML systems across areas such as generative AI, intelligent agents, predictive modeling, and optimization.</li><li>Develop reusable AI platforms, services, and infrastructure that accelerate experimentation, deployment, monitoring, and adoption across the firm.</li><li>Translate emerging AI capabilities into robust, scalable solutions that deliver measurable business impact.</li><li>Define evaluation, testing, and observability approaches for AI systems, including non-deterministic and agentic applications.</li><li>Optimize AI systems and workloads for latency, throughput, compute efficiency, reliability, security, and cost.</li><li>Partner with business, engineering, data, risk, and control teams to take solutions from concept through production deployment and ongoing operation.</li><li>Establish engineering standards, mentor engineers, and influence technical strategy across teams.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>The minimum requirements for this position are:</b></p><ul><li>8&#43; years of software engineering experience, including significant experience designing, building, and operating complex production systems.</li><li>4&#43; years of experience building and deploying AI/ML, optimization, or other model-driven applications in production.</li><li>Strong proficiency in Python and a track record of developing maintainable, well-tested production software.</li><li>Strong SQL skills and experience working with data-intensive applications and large-scale datasets.</li><li>Experience designing and building APIs, services, data pipelines, or distributed systems that support AI/ML applications.</li><li>Experience with containerization and orchestration technologies, such as Docker and Kubernetes.</li><li>Demonstrated ability to lead complex technical solutions from architecture and design through production deployment, operation, and continuous improvement.</li><li>Strong problem-solving, collaboration, and communication skills, with the ability to influence technical decisions across multidisciplinary teams.</li></ul><p></p><p><b>Additional knowledge and experience we value includes:</b></p><ul><li>Experience collaborating with research teams in fast-moving environments, ideating quickly on research prototypes.</li><li>Generative AI, large language models, AI agents, and architectures for production AI systems.</li><li>Evaluation, experimentation, observability, debugging, and testing approaches for AI/ML systems, including non-deterministic and agentic applications.</li><li>Machine learning and optimization frameworks such as PyTorch, TensorFlow, or JAX.</li><li>Distributed systems, cloud infrastructure, model serving, orchestration, data pipelines, and API design.</li><li>Performance optimization across latency, throughput, compute utilization, reliability, scalability, and cost.</li><li>Responsible AI, security, governance, and controls in enterprise or regulated environments.</li><li>Experience with a systems- or performance-oriented programming language such as Rust, C&#43;&#43;, C, Go, or Zig.</li><li>Experience in financial services or another regulated industry.</li></ul>&amp;#xa;For New York, NY Only the salary range for this position is USD$190,000.00 - USD$240,000.00 . Additionally, employees are eligible for an annual discretionary bonus, and benefits including healthcare, leave benefits, and retirement benefits. BlackRock operates a pay-for-performance compensation philosophy and your total compensation may vary based on role, location, and firm, department and individual performance.&amp;#xa;<p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b><span>Our benefits</span></b><br /><br /><span>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b><br />Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.<br /></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40LifeatBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858854986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;4m94z87I%2F5Y33edGFrw7b8oEwUqEPoMi8aRSP5Grc2E%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>YouTube</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858881999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JN9zBoi1f6dr35BovPmwulYT68B%2F1QHg3gR%2Bmg7TT14%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>X</u></span></a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40blackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858903740%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;aHv7vpILkjI1mNFebVSda3a0HnLsNeTO4nisrrZIFrc%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>TikTok</u></span></a>.<br /></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace. We are committed to equal employment opportunity to all applicants and existing employees, and we evaluate qualified applicants without regard to race, creed, color, national origin, sex (including pregnancy and gender <span><span><span><span><span class=\"WOR0\">identity/expression),</span></span></span></span></span> sexual orientation, age, ancestry, physical or mental disability, marital status, political affiliation, religion, citizenship status, genetic information, veteran status, or any other basis protected under applicable federal, state, or local law. <b>View the </b></span><b><a href=\"https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/regs/compliance/posters/pdf/22-088_EEOC_KnowYourRights.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">EEOC’s Know Your Rights poster and its supplement</a></b><span><b> and the </b></span><b><a href=\"https://www.dol.gov/sites/dolgov/files/OFCCP/pdf/pay-transp_%20English_formattedESQA508c.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">pay transparency statement</a><span>.</span></b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"><span> </span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is committed to full inclusion of all qualified individuals and to providing reasonable accommodations or job modifications for individuals with disabilities. If reasonable <span><span><span><span><span class=\"WOR0\">accommodation/adjustments</span></span></span></span></span> are needed throughout the employment process, please email <a href=\"mailto:Disability.Assistance&#64;blackrock.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span><span><span class=\"WOR0\">Disability.Assistance&#64;blackrock.com</span></span></span></span></span></a>. All requests are treated in line with our <a href=\"http://www.blackrock.com/corporate/compliance/privacy-policy#recruitment-privacy-notice\" target=\"_blank\"><b>privacy policy</b></a><a href=\"http://www.blackrock.com/corporate/compliance/privacy-policy#recruitment-privacy-notice\" target=\"_blank\">.</a></span></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p>BlackRock will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records in a manner consistent with the requirements of the law, including any applicable fair chance law.","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"United States of America","id":"bc33aa3152ec42d4995f4791a106ed09"},"posted_on":"Posted 4 Days Ago"},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T19:35:50.646Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":6,"level":"executive","term":null,"tracks":["ai-ml"],"role_matches":["Machine Learning","Artificial Intelligence"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["AI","Machine Learning"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["finance-ai"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/Mumbai-India/Artificial-Intelligence-Engineer--Portfolio-Management-Group--Associate_R264721","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/Mumbai-India/Artificial-Intelligence-Engineer--Portfolio-Management-Group--Associate_R264721","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"d46b1342fad265ce04ca11357c22278de8b20be887d64cae8e72d32edfa78749","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Artificial Intelligence Engineer, Portfolio Management Group, Associate","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Mumbai-India/Artificial-Intelligence-Engineer--Portfolio-Management-Group--Associate_R264721","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Mumbai-India/Artificial-Intelligence-Engineer--Portfolio-Management-Group--Associate_R264721","locations":[{"label":"Mumbai, India"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R264721","internal_job_id":"e49927398938100189f054bcbc420000","first_published_at":"2026-08-19","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nAbout Global Fixed Income Team\n\nBlackRock’s active fixed income portfolio strategies stretch across a range of investment styles and segments of the fixed income universe. The breadth and depth of our platform puts us in a strong position to potentially deliver attractive returns in various market environments. With a focus on alpha generation and risk management, the team uses a top-down view from lead portfolio managers and bottom-up expertise from our sector specialists.\n \nResponsibilities:\n- Design and develop generative AI and machine learning solutions to address fixed income investment and business problems\n\n- Experiment with and implement generative AI techniques such as retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), embeddings, and LLM-based workflows\n\n- Build, train, and fine-tune machine learning and deep learning models using appropriate frameworks and methodologies\n\n- Analyze large structured and unstructured datasets to extract insights, engineer features, and support model development\n\n- Apply statistical methods and hypothesis-driven experimentation to evaluate model performance and validate results\n\n- Work closely with portfolio managers, researchers, and business stakeholders to translate investment problems into data science solutions\n\n- Contribute to the deployment and integration of models into production systems, including APIs and scalable pipelines\n\n- Collaborate with data engineers to ensure high-quality data pipelines and efficient data access\n\n- Ensure adherence to responsible AI principles including model interpretability, fairness, and data governance\n\n- Communicate model outputs, insights, and recommendations clearly to technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\n- Stay updated with advancements in AI, machine learning, and quantitative methods to continuously enhance solutions\n\nEducation and Qualifications/Skills:\n- Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science/Engineering or related field.\n\n- 4+ years of relevant experience.\n\n- Good understanding of the foundations and working principles of machine learning algorithms, linear algebra, probability theory, statistics, and optimization theory.\n\n- Knowledge of at least one of the following domains: generative AI, statistical learning, optimization, NLP, deep learning or time series analysis.\n\n- Should have strong proficiency in the following\n\n- Languages: Python, SQ\n\n- Frameworks: PyTorch, TensorFlow, Scikit-learn, Hugging Face, LangChain, LlamaInde\n\n- Data & Storage: large‑scale distributed data analytics engines, Pandas, Snowflake, FAISS, Pinecone, Chrom\n\n- Familiarity with cloud platforms (GCP, Azure, AWS\n\n- Proficiency in version control systems (e.g., Git/GitHub).\n\n- Strong analytical thinking skills with an ability to creatively solve business problems, innovating new techniques as needed.\n\n- Excellent verbal and written communication skills.\n\n- Self-driven and results oriented team player with ability to collaborate effectively across geographies/time zones\n\n- Passion for solving interesting and relevant real-world problems in Finance using a data science and AI approaches.\n\n- Prior experience in financial services or large-scale enterprise systems is a plus.\n\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, family status, gender identity, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected attributes at law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b>About Global Fixed Income Team</b><br /><br />BlackRock’s active fixed income portfolio strategies stretch across a range of investment styles and segments of the fixed income universe. The breadth and depth of our platform puts us in a strong position to potentially deliver attractive returns in various market environments. With a focus on alpha generation and risk management, the team uses a top-down view from lead portfolio managers and bottom-up expertise from our sector specialists.<br /> <br /><b>Responsibilities:</b></p><ul><li><p>Design and develop generative AI and machine learning solutions to address fixed income investment and business problems</p></li><li><p>Experiment with and implement generative AI techniques such as retrieval-augmented generation (RAG), embeddings, and LLM-based workflows</p></li><li><p>Build, train, and fine-tune machine learning and deep learning models using appropriate frameworks and methodologies</p></li><li><p>Analyze large structured and unstructured datasets to extract insights, engineer features, and support model development</p></li><li><p>Apply statistical methods and hypothesis-driven experimentation to evaluate model performance and validate results</p></li><li><p>Work closely with portfolio managers, researchers, and business stakeholders to translate investment problems into data science solutions</p></li><li><p>Contribute to the deployment and integration of models into production systems, including APIs and scalable pipelines</p></li><li><p>Collaborate with data engineers to ensure high-quality data pipelines and efficient data access</p></li><li><p>Ensure adherence to responsible AI principles including model interpretability, fairness, and data governance</p></li><li><p>Communicate model outputs, insights, and recommendations clearly to technical and non-technical stakeholders.</p></li><li><p>Stay updated with advancements in AI, machine learning, and quantitative methods to continuously enhance solutions</p></li></ul><p><br /><b>Education and Qualifications/Skills:</b></p><ul><li><p>Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science/Engineering or related field.</p></li><li><p>4&#43; years of relevant experience.</p></li><li><p>Good understanding of the foundations and working principles of machine learning algorithms, linear algebra, probability theory, statistics, and optimization theory.</p></li><li><p>Knowledge of at least one of the following domains: generative AI, statistical learning, optimization, NLP, deep learning or time series analysis.</p></li><li><p>Should have strong proficiency in the following</p></li><li><p>Languages: Python, SQ</p></li><li><p>Frameworks: PyTorch, TensorFlow, Scikit-learn, Hugging Face, LangChain, LlamaInde</p></li><li><p>Data &amp; Storage: large‑scale distributed data analytics engines, Pandas, Snowflake, FAISS, Pinecone, Chrom</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with cloud platforms (GCP, Azure, AWS</p></li><li><p>Proficiency in version control systems (e.g., Git/GitHub).</p></li><li><p>Strong analytical thinking skills with an ability to creatively solve business problems, innovating new techniques as needed.</p></li><li><p>Excellent verbal and written communication skills.</p></li><li><p>Self-driven and results oriented team player with ability to collaborate effectively across geographies/time zones</p></li><li><p>Passion for solving interesting and relevant real-world problems in Finance using a data science and AI approaches.</p></li><li><p>Prior experience in financial services or large-scale enterprise systems is a plus.</p></li></ul><p></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b><span>Our benefits</span></b><br /><br /><span>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b><br />Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.<br /></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40LifeatBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858854986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;4m94z87I%2F5Y33edGFrw7b8oEwUqEPoMi8aRSP5Grc2E%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>YouTube</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858881999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JN9zBoi1f6dr35BovPmwulYT68B%2F1QHg3gR%2Bmg7TT14%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>X</u></span></a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40blackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858903740%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;aHv7vpILkjI1mNFebVSda3a0HnLsNeTO4nisrrZIFrc%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>TikTok</u></span></a>.<br /></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, family status, gender identity, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected attributes at law.</span></p>","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"India","id":"c4f78be1a8f14da0ab49ce1162348a5e"},"posted_on":"Posted 5 Days Ago"},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T05:34:36.556Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":2,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["ai-ml"],"role_matches":["Artificial Intelligence"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":[],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["finance-ai"]}}
