{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/London-Greater-London/Full-Stack-Software-Engineer--Associate---Preqin-Engineering_R265817","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/London-Greater-London/Full-Stack-Software-Engineer--Associate---Preqin-Engineering_R265817","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"8714dc15b6716868e4b57c9ed246f66b5c10c1582e740ced9923182483137998","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Full Stack Software Engineer, Associate – Preqin Engineering","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/London-Greater-London/Full-Stack-Software-Engineer--Associate---Preqin-Engineering_R265817","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/London-Greater-London/Full-Stack-Software-Engineer--Associate---Preqin-Engineering_R265817","locations":[{"label":"London, Greater London"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R265817","internal_job_id":"fbb98e7a008a10014800c1b652380000","first_published_at":"2026-08-12","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nYour team  \n\nPreqin , part of BlackRock, is seeking a Full Stack Software Engineer (Associate) to join the London Engineering team. The team develops and supports technology solutions that power Preqin's private markets platform, helping clients access high-quality data, analytics, and workflow capabilities globally. You will work with a collaborative, international engineering team focused on delivering scalable, cloud-first solutions while applying modern software engineering practices across the full product lifecycle.  \n\n \n\nYour role and impact  \n\nAs a Full Stack Software Engineer , you will contribute to the design, development, deployment, and support of critical Preqin products. This role offers the opportunity to work across both backend and frontend technologies, with a particular emphasis on building robust services using Python and .NET alongside modern React-based user experiences. You will help drive engineering excellence, contribute to architectural decisions, and support the evolution of products that serve a global client base in the private markets industry.  \n\n \n\nYour responsibilities  \n\nIn every role at BlackRock, you'll be expected to apply sound judgement and critical thinking to solve complex problems, adapt as the business evolves, and combine the curiosity to explore new approaches and technologies with the rigor to challenge the results. The scope of this role also includes the following responsibilities:  \n\n- Build new features end-to-end, from concept and design through production deployment and support.  \n\n- Develop and maintain scalable backend services using Python and .NET, and create intuitive frontend experiences using React and TypeScript.  \n\n- Take ownership of components within a Software as a Service (SaaS) platform, including production monitoring, operational support, and incident resolution in cloud environments.  \n\n- Apply information security principles throughout software design, development, testing, and deployment activities.  \n\n- Contribute to engineering excellence through Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery (CI/CD), automated testing, code reviews, and continuous improvement initiatives.  \n\n- Collaborate closely with product, engineering, and business stakeholders to deliver high-quality solutions that meet client and business needs.  \n\n- Contribute to the design and evolution of cloud-native, distributed systems and modern application architectures.  \n\n \n\nYour experience  \n\n- Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science , Engineering, Mathematics, Organizational Sciences, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.  \n\n- Demonstrated experience developing backend applications with Python and .NET, together with frontend development using modern frameworks such as React and TypeScript.  \n\n- Strong understanding of software engineering principles, Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts, and best practices, combined with strong analytical, problem-solving, and prioritization skills.  \n\n- Experience designing, building, and integrating APIs using Representational State Transfer (REST), gRPC , and modern microservices-based architectures.  \n\n- Experience working within existing codebases and contributing to the deployment of cloud-native applications.  \n\n- Strong communication skills in English and an interest in understanding business and product domains; experience in financial services is beneficial.  \n\n- Familiarity with data technologies such as Microsoft SQL Server, MongoDB, and Snowflake.  \n\n \n\nNice to have  \n\n- Experience with Java development.  \n\n- Experience with GraphQL APIs and application integrations.  \n\n- Exposure to Amazon Web Services (AWS).  \n\n- Familiarity with enterprise-grade container orchestration platforms supporting declarative infrastructure and horizontal scaling.  \n\n- Familiarity with modern DevOps practices and cloud-native engineering approaches.\n\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of employee benefits including: retirement investment and tools designed to help you in building a sound financial future; access to education reimbursement; comprehensive resources to support your physical health and emotional well-being; family support programs; and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected characteristics at law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><div><div><p><b><span>Your team</span></b><span> </span></p></div><div><p><span><span>Preqin</span><span>, part of BlackRock, is seeking a </span><span>Full Stack Software Engineer</span><span> </span><span>(Associate) to join the London Engineering team. The team develops and supports technology solutions that power </span><span>Preqin&#39;s</span><span> private markets platform, helping clients access high-quality data, analytics, and workflow capabilities globally. You will work with a collaborative, international engineering team focused on delivering scalable, cloud-first solutions while applying modern software engineering practices across the full product lifecycle.</span></span><span> </span></p></div><div><p><span> </span></p></div><div><p><b><span>Your role and impact</span></b><span> </span></p></div><div><p><span><span>As a </span><span>Full Stack Software Engineer</span><span>, you will contribute to the design, development, deployment, and support of critical </span><span>Preqin</span><span> products. This role offers the opportunity to work across both backend and </span><span>frontend</span><span> technologies, with a particular emphasis on building robust services using Python and .NET alongside modern React-based user experiences. You will help drive engineering excellence, contribute to architectural decisions, and support the evolution of products that serve a global client base in the private markets industry.</span></span><span> </span></p></div><div><p><span> </span></p></div><div><p><b><span>Your responsibilities</span></b><span> </span></p></div><div><p><span><span>In every role at BlackRock, </span><span>you&#39;ll</span><span> be expected to apply sound judgement and critical thinking to solve complex problems, adapt as the business evolves, and combine the curiosity to explore </span><span>new approaches</span><span> and technologies with the rigor to challenge the results. The scope of this role also includes the following responsibilities:</span></span><span> </span></p></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Build new features end-to-end, from concept and design through production deployment and support.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Develop and </span><span>maintain</span><span> scalable backend services using Python and </span><span>.NET, and</span><span> create intuitive frontend experiences using React and TypeScript.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Take ownership of components within a Software as a Service (SaaS) platform, including production monitoring, operational support, and incident resolution in cloud environments.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Apply information security principles throughout software design, development, testing, and deployment activities.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Contribute to engineering excellence through Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery (CI/CD), automated testing, code reviews, and continuous improvement initiatives.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Collaborate closely with product, engineering, and business stakeholders to deliver high-quality solutions that meet client and business needs.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Contribute to the design and evolution of cloud-native, distributed systems and modern application architectures.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><p><span> </span></p></div><div><p><b><span>Your experience</span></b><span> </span></p></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Bachelor&#39;s or </span><span>Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science</span><span>, Engineering, Mathematics, Organizational Sciences, or a related field, or equivalent practical experience.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div></div><div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Demonstrated experience developing backend applications with Python and .NET, together with frontend development using modern frameworks such as React and TypeScript.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Strong understanding of software engineering principles, Object-Oriented Programming (OOP) concepts, and best practices, combined with strong analytical, problem-solving, and prioritization skills.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Experience designing, building, and integrating APIs using Representational State Transfer (REST), </span><span>gRPC</span><span>, and modern microservices-based architectures.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Experience working within existing codebases and contributing to the deployment of cloud-native applications.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Strong communication</span><span> skills in English and an interest in understanding business and product domains; experience in financial services is beneficial.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Familiarity with data technologies such as Microsoft SQL Server, MongoDB, and Snowflake.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><p><span> </span></p></div><div><p><b><span>Nice to have</span></b><span> </span></p></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Experience with Java development.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Experience with </span><span>GraphQL</span><span> APIs and application integrations.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Exposure to</span><span> Amazon Web Services (AWS).</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Familiarity with enterprise-grade container orchestration platforms supporting declarative infrastructure and horizontal scaling.</span></span><span> </span></p></li></ul></div><div><ul><li><p><span><span>Familiarity with modern DevOps practices and cloud-native engineering approaches.</span></span></p></li></ul></div></div><p></p><p><b>Our benefits</b></p><p></p><p>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of employee benefits including: retirement investment and tools designed to help you in building a sound financial future; access to education reimbursement; comprehensive resources to support your physical health and emotional well-being; family support programs; and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b><br />Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.<br /></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40LifeatBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858854986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;4m94z87I%2F5Y33edGFrw7b8oEwUqEPoMi8aRSP5Grc2E%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>YouTube</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858881999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JN9zBoi1f6dr35BovPmwulYT68B%2F1QHg3gR%2Bmg7TT14%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>X</u></span></a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40blackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858903740%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;aHv7vpILkjI1mNFebVSda3a0HnLsNeTO4nisrrZIFrc%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>TikTok</u></span></a>.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected characteristics at law.</span></p>","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"United Kingdom","id":"29247e57dbaf46fb855b224e03170bc7