{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/Mumbai-India/Software-Engineer--Python-SQL----Portfolio-Management-Group--Analyst_R264724","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/Mumbai-India/Software-Engineer--Python-SQL----Portfolio-Management-Group--Analyst_R264724","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"57b66c66896da222639b75db5ea548962683f507a91df1729ff110ebc3a39882","fetched_at":"2026-08-24T01:56:20.339Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Software Engineer (Python,SQL,React) , Portfolio Management Group, Analyst","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Mumbai-India/Software-Engineer--Python-SQL----Portfolio-Management-Group--Analyst_R264724","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Mumbai-India/Software-Engineer--Python-SQL----Portfolio-Management-Group--Analyst_R264724","locations":[{"label":"Mumbai, India"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R264724","internal_job_id":"d803117fd5a11000e09a8df137290000","first_published_at":"2026-08-05","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nAbout Global Fixed Income Team\n\nBlackRock’s active fixed income portfolio strategies stretch across a range of investment styles and segments of the fixed income universe. The breadth and depth of our platform puts us in a strong position to potentially deliver attractive returns in various market environments. With a focus on alpha generation and risk management, the team uses a top-down view from lead portfolio managers and bottom-up expertise from our sector specialists\n\nAbout the Role :\n\nWe are looking to hire a an Analyst-level Software Engineer who understands the software development lifecycle very well. The individual The individual will design, develop, test, and maintain backend-focused software applications, APIs, data workflows, and analytical tools. The role will also involve working closely with business stakeholders to understand requirements and translate them into practical technical solutions.\n\nKey Responsibilities\n- Design, develop, and maintain software components in line with functional and technical requirements\n\n- Develop backend services, APIs, data-processing workflows, and automation solutions using Python.\n\n- Contribute to full-stack applications, with a primary focus on backend development and limited front-end development.\n\n- Work with structured and unstructured data to support analytics, reporting, and AI-enabled solutions.\n\n- Partner with business stakeholders to gather requirements, document use cases, and translate business needs into technical solutions.\n\n- Investigate technical and data-related issues, perform root-cause analysis, and recommend scalable solutions.\n\n- Support automation efforts by contributing to test scripts and reusable validation frameworks where applicable\n\n- Monitor application behaviour, analyse root causes of issues, and recommend improvements to quality and reliability\n\n- Use tools such as Git and defect tracking platforms to support collaborative delivery and testing processes\n\nRequired Skills\n\nCore Technical Skills\n- Strong programming fundamentals and hands-on experience with Python and SQL are required.\n\n- Knowledge of React/Java is a good to have.\n\n- Understanding of software development lifecycle (SDLC) and software testing lifecycle (STLC)\n\n- Knowledge of manual testing, defect tracking, and test case design\n\n- Familiarity with test automation concepts and tools such as Selenium or similar frameworks\n\n- Experience with version control systems and collaborative development workflows\n\n- Awareness of API testing, integration testing concepts, and quality assurance best practices\n\n- Understanding of REST APIs, databases, data pipelines, and application integration.\n\n- Basic knowledge of React, JavaScript, TypeScript, or another front-end technology is beneficial.\n\n- Familiarity with data analysis, AI, machine learning, or generative AI concepts is beneficial.\n\nEducation & Qualifications\n- 1-3 years of relevant work experience\n\n- Bachelor's or Master's degree in Computer Science/Engineering or related field.\n\nProblem-Solving\n- Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, including root-cause analysis.\n\n- Ability to gather requirements and translate business needs into technical solutions.\n\n- Clear communication with technical and non-technical stakeholders.\n\n.\n\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, family status, gender identity, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected attributes at law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b>About Global Fixed Income Team</b><br /><br />BlackRock’s active fixed income portfolio strategies stretch across a range of investment styles and segments of the fixed income universe. The breadth and depth of our platform puts us in a strong position to potentially deliver attractive returns in various market environments. With a focus on alpha generation and risk management, the team uses a top-down view from lead portfolio managers and bottom-up expertise from our sector specialists</p><p></p><p><b>About the Role :</b></p><p></p><p>We are looking to hire a an Analyst-level Software Engineer who understands the software development lifecycle very well. The individual <span>The individual will design, develop, test, and maintain backend-focused software applications, APIs, data workflows, and analytical tools. The role will also involve working closely with business stakeholders to understand requirements and translate them into practical technical solutions.</span></p><p></p><p><span><span><b>Key Responsibilities </b></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span>Design, develop, and maintain software components in line with functional and technical requirements</span></p></li><li><p><span>Develop backend services, APIs, data-processing workflows, and automation solutions using Python.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Contribute to full-stack applications, with a primary focus on backend development and limited front-end development.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Work with structured and unstructured data to support analytics, reporting, and AI-enabled solutions.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Partner with business stakeholders to gather requirements, document use cases, and translate business needs into technical solutions.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Investigate technical and data-related issues, perform root-cause analysis, and recommend scalable solutions.</span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Support automation efforts by contributing to test scripts and reusable validation frameworks where applicable</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Monitor application behaviour, analyse root causes of issues, and recommend improvements to quality and reliability</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Use tools such as Git and defect tracking platforms to support collaborative delivery and testing processes</span></span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><span><span><b>Required Skills</b></span></span></p><p></p><p><span><span><b>Core Technical Skills</b></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span>Strong programming fundamentals and hands-on experience with Python and SQL are required.</span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Knowledge of React/Java is a good to have.</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Understanding of software development lifecycle (SDLC) and software testing lifecycle (STLC)</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Knowledge of manual testing, defect tracking, and test case design</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Familiarity with test automation concepts and tools such as Selenium or similar frameworks</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Experience with version control systems and collaborative development workflows</span></span></p></li><li><p><span><span>Awareness of API testing, integration testing concepts, and quality assurance best practices</span></span></p></li><li><p><span>Understanding of REST APIs, databases, data pipelines, and application integration.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Basic knowledge of React, JavaScript, TypeScript, or another front-end technology is beneficial.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Familiarity with data analysis, AI, machine learning, or generative AI concepts is beneficial.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Education &amp; Qualifications</b></p><ul><li><p>1-3 years of relevant work experience</p></li><li><p>Bachelor&#39;s or Master&#39;s degree in Computer Science/Engineering or related field.</p><p></p></li></ul><p><span><span><b>Problem-Solving</b></span></span></p><ul><li><p><span>Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, including root-cause analysis.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Ability to gather requirements and translate business needs into technical solutions.</span></p></li><li><p><span>Clear communication with technical and non-technical stakeholders.</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p></p><p>.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b><span>Our benefits</span></b><br /><br /><span>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b><br />Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.<br /></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40LifeatBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858854986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;4m94z87I%2F5Y33edGFrw7b8oEwUqEPoMi8aRSP5Grc2E%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>YouTube</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858881999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JN9zBoi1f6dr35BovPmwulYT68B%2F1QHg3gR%2Bmg7TT14%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>X</u></span></a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40blackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858903740%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;aHv7vpILkjI1mNFebVSda3a0HnLsNeTO4nisrrZIFrc%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>TikTok</u></span></a>.<br /></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, family status, gender identity, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected attributes at law.</span></p>","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"India","id":"c4f78be1a8f14da0ab49ce1162348a5e"},"posted_on":"Posted 18 Days Ago"},"status":"closed","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T05:34:36.556Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-24T01:56:20.339Z","closed_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","possibly_closed_at":"2026-08-24T14:15:46.938Z","missing_complete_scans":2,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":3,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["finance-ai"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/Edinburgh-Scotland/Software-Engineer--Associate_R263964","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/Edinburgh-Scotland/Software-Engineer--Associate_R263964","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"ccdc5d0317356c0bd4125d63fa5bc993a7d753647304e0ebd2926a957040a883","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Software Engineer, Associate","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Edinburgh-Scotland/Software-Engineer--Associate_R263964","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Edinburgh-Scotland/Software-Engineer--Associate_R263964","locations":[{"label":"Edinburgh, Scotland"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R263964","internal_job_id":"9253b6b536d71001f477589fa9c00000","first_published_at":"2026-08-06","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nAladdin Platform Eng-ES-Identity Engineering\n\nYou are:\nCurious and eager to learn new things, with a healthy disrespect for the status quo\nExcited to learn about new technologies and strive to reach new levels of efficiencies in the platform we provide.\nPassionate about technology, with personal ownership for the work you do\nData-focused, with an eye for the details that matter to solve the problem\nProficient in using AI for day-to-day engineering work.\n\nWe are:\nPassionate about building quality software and scaling technology to meet the needs of tomorrow\nBuilding solutions for BlackRock and over over 200 institutions that rely on our technology who use our technology\nWorking closely with enterprise identity providers (e.g., Okta/Azure AD) and modern auth standards to deliver secure, scalable solutions.\n· A platform team responsible for identity management, authentication, and access foundations that enable seamless and secure access to Aladdin applications and APIs.\n· Focused on operational excellence and reliability—improving telemetry, strengthening controls, and reducing friction for our users and partner teams.\n· Building and operating production services in Java, Python, and Golang using technologies like distributed event streaming and messaging platforms, Enterprise-grade container orchestration platform supporting declarative infrastructure and horizontal scaling, Redis (and more), with a strong emphasis on testability and safe rollout.\n· Working closely with enterprise identity providers (e.g., Okta/Azure AD/Keycloak) and modern auth standards to deliver secure, scalable solutions.\n\nYou have (Must have):\n· Minimum of 3+ years of software engineering experience building and supporting production services.\n· BS/MS in Computer Science from an accredited university (or equivalent practical experience).\n· Strong programming skills in Java, Python, or Golang (and willingness to learn the others).\n· Experience working in Linux environments (shell, basic debugging, log analysis).\n· Solid understanding of API fundamentals (HTTP, authentication basics, error handling).\n\nYou have (Nice to have):\n· Demonstrated understanding and practical experience with authentication and authorization mechanisms such as OAuth 2.0/OpenID Connect, mTLS, TLS/SSL, certificate-based auth, JWT, SAML, and PKI infrastructure.\n· Hands-on experience configuring/managing/integrating with Okta, Azure AD, or Keycloak.\n· Experience with API frameworks and spec-first development, including Google API Improvement Proposals (AIPs) and protobuf.\n· Familiarity with distributed systems and platform tooling (distributed event streaming and messaging platforms, Enterprise-grade container orchestration platform supporting declarative infrastructure and horizontal scaling, caching, CI/CD) and observability (metrics/logging/tracing).\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of employee benefits including: retirement investment and tools designed to help you in building a sound financial future; access to education reimbursement; comprehensive resources to support your physical health and emotional well-being; family support programs; and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected characteristics at law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p>Aladdin Platform Eng-ES-Identity Engineering\n\nYou are:\nCurious and eager to learn new things, with a healthy disrespect for the status quo\nExcited to learn about new technologies and strive to reach new levels of efficiencies in the platform we provide.\nPassionate about technology, with personal ownership for the work you do\nData-focused, with an eye for the details that matter to solve the problem\nProficient in using AI for day-to-day engineering work.\n\nWe are:\nPassionate about building quality software and scaling technology to meet the needs of tomorrow\nBuilding solutions for BlackRock and over over 200 institutions that rely on our technology who use our technology\nWorking closely with enterprise identity providers (e.g., Okta/Azure AD) and modern auth standards to deliver secure, scalable solutions. \n·                     A platform team responsible for identity management, authentication, and access foundations that enable seamless and secure access to Aladdin applications and APIs. \n·                     Focused on operational excellence and reliability—improving telemetry, strengthening controls, and reducing friction for our users and partner teams. \n·                     Building and operating production services in Java, Python, and Golang using technologies like distributed event streaming and messaging platforms, Enterprise-grade container orchestration platform supporting declarative infrastructure and horizontal scaling, Redis (and more), with a strong emphasis on testability and safe rollout. \n·                     Working closely with enterprise identity providers (e.g., Okta/Azure AD/Keycloak) and modern auth standards to deliver secure, scalable solutions. \n\nYou have (Must have): \n·                     Minimum of 3+ years of software engineering experience building and supporting production services. \n·                     BS/MS in Computer Science from an accredited university (or equivalent practical experience). \n·                     Strong programming skills in Java, Python, or Golang (and willingness to learn the others). \n·                     Experience working in Linux environments (shell, basic debugging, log analysis). \n·                     Solid understanding of API fundamentals (HTTP, authentication basics, error handling). \n\nYou have (Nice to have): \n·                     Demonstrated understanding and practical experience with authentication and authorization mechanisms such as OAuth 2.0/OpenID Connect, mTLS, TLS/SSL, certificate-based auth, JWT, SAML, and PKI infrastructure. \n·                     Hands-on experience configuring/managing/integrating with Okta, Azure AD, or Keycloak. \n·                     Experience with API frameworks and spec-first development, including Google API Improvement Proposals (AIPs) and protobuf. \n·                     Familiarity with distributed systems and platform tooling (distributed event streaming and messaging platforms, Enterprise-grade container orchestration platform supporting declarative infrastructure and horizontal scaling, caching, CI/CD) and observability (metrics/logging/tracing).<p></p><p><b>Our benefits</b></p><p></p><p>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of employee benefits including: retirement investment and tools designed to help you in building a sound financial future; access to education reimbursement; comprehensive resources to support your physical health and emotional well-being; family support programs; and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b><br />Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.<br /></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40LifeatBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858854986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;4m94z87I%2F5Y33edGFrw7b8oEwUqEPoMi8aRSP5Grc2E%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>YouTube</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858881999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JN9zBoi1f6dr35BovPmwulYT68B%2F1QHg3gR%2Bmg7TT14%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>X</u></span></a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40blackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858903740%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;aHv7vpILkjI1mNFebVSda3a0HnLsNeTO4nisrrZIFrc%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>TikTok</u></span></a>.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected characteristics at law.</span></p>","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"United Kingdom","id":"29247e57dbaf46fb855b224e03170bc7"},"posted_on":"Posted 18 Days Ago"},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T05:34:36.556Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":3,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["finance-ai"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/London-Greater-London/Software-Engineer--Associate_R265848","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/London-Greater-London/Software-Engineer--Associate_R265848","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"32826bd8b30bf9962ebbd8e95b137a9900556c46f1decf920604968e68153bc7","fetched_at":"2026-08-24T14:15:46.938Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Software Engineer, Associate","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/London-Greater-London/Software-Engineer--Associate_R265848","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/London-Greater-London/Software-Engineer--Associate_R265848","locations":[{"label":"London, Greater London"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R265848","internal_job_id":"1759300e117a1001401bcd6b68050000","first_published_at":"2026-08-05","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nAre you passionate about building software solutions and platforms from the ground up? Would you like to help drive the digital transformations in the private equity industry?\n \nWe are looking for a Software Engineer to join our team and build one of the most important new products from the ground up, which is at the center of our technology initiatives.\n \nThe Software Engineering team serves to drive our technology development and deliver cutting edge and innovative solutions to both our clients and business teams. Improving the client experience as well as the business processes and efficiencies.\n \nThe Impact: \n- Engineering excellence, collaboration, and knowledge sharing.\n- Be a team player: resonate with and demonstrate our values, criticize constructively, and help create a world class engineering organization.\n \nRoles and Responsibilities:\n \n- Support the complete Software Development Life Cycle (requirements gathering, development, testing, deployment, support).\n- Develop software that is modular, reusable, and extensible.\n- Write code that is easy to understand and maintain.\n- Design and implement low-latency, high-availability, and performant applications.\n- Perform unit tests and develop automated tests.\n- Build RESTful APIs.\n- Conduct timely code reviews.\n \nKey requirement for this role:\n \nWe expect you to have a solid foundation in data structures, programming languages, common design patterns, and software engineering best practices.\n \n- Bachelor’s degree in Software Engineering or Computer Science, or related degree.\n- Development experience in .Net, .Net Core, ASP.Net Core and C#\n- Knowledge and experience using important .NET and C# language features such as encapsulation, inheritance, interfaces, polymorphism, generics, exception handling, reflection, attributes, LINQ, and asynchronous programming, etc.\n- Experience in using Entity Framework for data persistence\n- Experience developing software with structured logging, preferably using a mature logging framework\n- Knowledge and experience in SQL query language, SQL database schema design and developing software that access SQL databases\n- Knowledge and experience in the HTTP protocol, REST API, authentication and authorization standards and methods\n- Experience using API testing utilities such as Postman or cURL\n- Knowledge and experience in Azure or AWS is a plus\n- Experience using design patterns to achieve good architecture in development work\n- Experience in troubleshooting and debugging issues and unblock development work by thinking out of the box and resolving problems independently\n- Experience creating unit test programs to validate software component functionalities\n- Experience using modern source code management systems such as Git in software development and collaboration with other developers\n- Experience working with continuous integration and development (CI/CD) systems\n- Ability to automate solutions to repetitive problems and tasks\n- Demonstrative written and verbal communication skills working with audiences with a wide variety of technical expertise\n- Passion for learning and using new technologies\n\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of employee benefits including: retirement investment and tools designed to help you in building a sound financial future; access to education reimbursement; comprehensive resources to support your physical health and emotional well-being; family support programs; and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected characteristics at law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><span><span>Are you passionate about building software solutions and platforms from the ground up? Would you like to help drive the digital transformations in the private equity industry?</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>We are looking for a Software Engineer to join our team and build one of the most important new products from the ground up, which is at the center of our technology initiatives.</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>The Software Engineering team serves to drive our technology development and deliver cutting edge and innovative solutions to both our clients and business teams. Improving the client experience as well as the business processes and efficiencies.</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span><b><u>The Impact: </u></b></span></span></p><ul><li><span><span>Engineering excellence, collaboration, and knowledge sharing.</span></span></li><li><span><span>Be a team player: resonate with and demonstrate our values, criticize constructively, and help create a world class engineering organization.</span></span></li></ul><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span><b><u>Roles and Responsibilities:</u></b></span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><ul><li><span><span>Support the complete Software Development Life Cycle (requirements gathering, development, testing, deployment, support).</span></span></li><li><span><span>Develop software that is modular, reusable, and extensible.</span></span></li><li><span><span>Write code that is easy to understand and maintain.</span></span></li><li><span><span>Design and implement low-latency, high-availability, and performant applications.</span></span></li><li><span><span>Perform unit tests and develop automated tests.</span></span></li><li><span><span>Build RESTful APIs.</span></span></li><li><span><span>Conduct timely code reviews.</span></span></li></ul><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span><b><u>Key requirement for this role:</u></b></span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>We expect you to have a solid foundation in data structures, programming languages, common design patterns, and software engineering best practices.</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><ul><li><span><span>Bachelor’s degree in Software Engineering or Computer Science, or related degree.</span></span></li><li><span><span>Development experience in .Net, .Net Core, ASP.Net Core and C#</span></span></li><li><span><span>Knowledge and experience using important .NET and C# language features such as encapsulation, inheritance, interfaces, polymorphism, generics, exception handling, reflection, attributes, LINQ, and asynchronous programming, etc.</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience in using Entity Framework for data persistence</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience developing software with structured logging, preferably using a mature logging framework</span></span></li><li><span><span>Knowledge and experience in SQL query language, SQL database schema design and developing software that access SQL databases</span></span></li><li><span><span>Knowledge and experience in the HTTP protocol, REST API, authentication and authorization standards and methods</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience using API testing utilities such as Postman or cURL</span></span></li><li><span><span>Knowledge and experience in Azure or AWS is a plus</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience using design patterns to achieve good architecture in development work</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience in troubleshooting and debugging issues and unblock development work by thinking out of the box and resolving problems independently</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience creating unit test programs to validate software component functionalities</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience using modern source code management systems such as Git in software development and collaboration with other developers</span></span></li><li><span><span>Experience working with continuous integration and development (CI/CD) systems</span></span></li><li><span><span>Ability to automate solutions to repetitive problems and tasks</span></span></li><li><span><span>Demonstrative written and verbal communication skills working with audiences with a wide variety of technical expertise</span></span></li><li><span><span>Passion for learning and using new technologies</span></span></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Our benefits</b></p><p></p><p>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of employee benefits including: retirement investment and tools designed to help you in building a sound financial future; access to education reimbursement; comprehensive resources to support your physical health and emotional well-being; family support programs; and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</p><p></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b><br />Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.<br /></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.youtube.com%2F%40LifeatBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858854986%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;4m94z87I%2F5Y33edGFrw7b8oEwUqEPoMi8aRSP5Grc2E%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>YouTube</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2FBlackRock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858881999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JN9zBoi1f6dr35BovPmwulYT68B%2F1QHg3gR%2Bmg7TT14%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>X</u></span></a>, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.tiktok.com%2F%40blackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858903740%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;aHv7vpILkjI1mNFebVSda3a0HnLsNeTO4nisrrZIFrc%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>TikTok</u></span></a>.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span>BlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to age, disability, race, religion, sex, sexual orientation and other protected characteristics at law.</span></p>","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"United Kingdom","id":"29247e57dbaf46fb855b224e03170bc7"},"posted_on":"Posted 19 Days Ago"},"status":"possibly_closed","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T05:34:36.556Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-24T14:15:46.938Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","missing_complete_scans":1,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":3,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["software"],"role_matches":["Software Engineer"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":["Software Engineer"],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["finance-ai"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:blackrock-blackrock-professional:/job/Mexico-City-Mexico/Software-Engineer--Python---Associate--Mexico-City_R263206","source":{"type":"workday","board":"blackrock-BlackRock_Professional","job_id":"/job/Mexico-City-Mexico/Software-Engineer--Python---Associate--Mexico-City_R263206","source_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/blackrock/BlackRock_Professional/jobs","response_hash":"1c2a9ba5845cee71564179b668ae4004aedb286dcda6de48fedcffc747dac717","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"BlackRock","slug":"blackrock","lists":["finance-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Software Engineer, Python - Associate, Mexico City","canonical_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Mexico-City-Mexico/Software-Engineer--Python---Associate--Mexico-City_R263206","apply_url":"https://blackrock.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BlackRock_Professional/job/Mexico-City-Mexico/Software-Engineer--Python---Associate--Mexico-City_R263206","locations":[{"label":"Mexico City, Mexico"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R263206","internal_job_id":"a2fc9d28566010015877bbb663040000","first_published_at":"2026-07-07","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"About this role\n\nRole Description:\n\nData Strategy & Solutions (DS&S) is accelerating the future of investment research at BlackRock with alternative data, insights, and emerging technology. We are looking for a motivated and detail-oriented Software Engineer to join our team.\n\nAs a Software Engineer, you will support the development of data-centric applications that empower investment teams in their research processes. You will work closely with senior engineers and cross-functional teams to build efficient, scalable tools that enable data-driven insights.\n\nThis role offers a unique opportunity to gain exposure to cutting-edge technologies in a collaborative, fast-paced environment while contributing to impactful projects.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n- Assist in the design, development, and maintenance of platform applications that support data-driven decision-making and research processes\n\n- Collaborate with senior engineers and stakeholders to understand project requirements and deliver high-quality solutions\n\n- Contribute to the integration of emerging technologies, such as AI, into platform applications\n\n- Write clean, maintainable, and efficient code in Python and SQL\n\n- Participate in code reviews, testing, and debugging processes to ensure the quality of applications\n\nQualifications :\n- Education: Bachelor’s in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, or related field; advanced degrees or certifications are a plus\n\n- Experience: 1-2 years of professional experience in software engineering, data engineering, or related fields\n\n- Familiarity with cloud technologies (e.g. Google Cloud, AWS, or Azure) and cloud-native architecture\n\n- Proficiency in Python and SQL; experience with additional programming languages is a plus\n\n- Demonstrated interest in learning about AI and its applications in software engineering\n\n- Strong problem-solving and analytical skills with flexibility to adapt to new technologies\n\nOur benefits\n\nTo help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.\n\nOur hybrid work model\n\nBlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.\n\nGuidance on AI use for candidates\n\nAt BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided guidance  on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.\n\nAbout BlackRock\n\nAt BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.\n\nThis mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.\n\nTo learn more about BlackRock, please visit Careers.BlackRock.com . We also encourage you to get to know us on LinkedIn , Instagram , YouTube , X , and TikTok .\n\nBlackRock is proud to be an Equal Opportunity Employer.  We evaluate qualified applicants without regard to race, color, national origin, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, disability, protected veteran status, and other statuses protected by law.\n\nBlackRock will consider for employment qualified applicants with arrest or conviction records in a manner consistent with the requirements of the law, including any applicable fair chance law.","description_html":"<p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>About this role</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p><b>Role Description:</b></p><p></p><p>Data Strategy &amp; Solutions (DS&amp;S) is accelerating the future of investment research at BlackRock with alternative data, insights, and emerging technology. We are looking for a motivated and detail-oriented Software Engineer to join our team.</p><p></p><p>As a Software Engineer, you will support the development of data-centric applications that empower investment teams in their research processes. You will work closely with senior engineers and cross-functional teams to build efficient, scalable tools that enable data-driven insights.</p><p></p><p>This role offers a unique opportunity to gain exposure to cutting-edge technologies in a collaborative, fast-paced environment while contributing to impactful projects.</p><p></p><p><b>Key Responsibilities:</b></p><ul><li><p>Assist in the design, development, and maintenance of platform applications that support data-driven decision-making and research processes</p></li><li><p>Collaborate with senior engineers and stakeholders to understand project requirements and deliver high-quality solutions</p></li><li><p>Contribute to the integration of emerging technologies, such as AI, into platform applications</p></li><li><p>Write clean, maintainable, and efficient code in Python and SQL</p></li><li><p>Participate in code reviews, testing, and debugging processes to ensure the quality of applications</p></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Qualifications</b>:</p><ul><li><p>Education: Bachelor’s in Computer Science, Engineering, Data Science, or related field; advanced degrees or certifications are a plus</p></li><li><p>Experience: 1-2 years of professional experience in software engineering, data engineering, or related fields</p></li><li><p>Familiarity with cloud technologies (e.g. Google Cloud, AWS, or Azure) and cloud-native architecture</p></li><li><p>Proficiency in Python and SQL; experience with additional programming languages is a plus</p></li><li><p>Demonstrated interest in learning about AI and its applications in software engineering</p></li><li><p>Strong problem-solving and analytical skills with flexibility to adapt to new technologies</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b><span>Our benefits</span></b><br /><br /><span>To help you stay energized, engaged and inspired, we offer a wide range of benefits including a strong retirement plan, tuition reimbursement, comprehensive healthcare, support for working parents and Flexible Time Off (FTO) so you can relax, recharge and be there for the people you care about.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Our hybrid work model</b></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">BlackRock’s hybrid work model is designed to enable a culture of collaboration and apprenticeship that enriches the experience of our employees, while supporting flexibility for all. Employees are currently required to work at least 4 days in the office per week, with the flexibility to work from home 1 day a week. Some business groups may require more time in the office due to their roles and responsibilities. We remain focused on increasing the impactful moments that arise when we work together in person – aligned with our commitment to performance and innovation. As a new joiner, you can count on this hybrid model to accelerate your learning and onboarding experience here at BlackRock.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><br /><p><b>Guidance on AI use for candidates</b></p><br /><p>At BlackRock, AI has long been part of how we work – enhancing decision-making, improving operations, and helping us deliver better outcomes for clients. We encourage candidates to use AI thoughtfully to learn, prepare, and work more effectively; but during our interview process, we want to focus on getting to know you through your own experiences, thinking, and judgment. To support you, we’ve provided <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2Fen%2Fai-interview-guidance&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858686005%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;whXuYBXo637EPj15E8LLiyRsdWphXOyPK8ODdCxk2Xs%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><b>guidance</b></span></a> on when and how to use AI during our hiring process so you can approach each step with confidence and showcase your best self.</p><br /><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>About BlackRock</b></p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">At BlackRock, we are all connected by one mission: to help more and more people experience financial well-being.  Our clients, and the people they serve, are saving for retirement, paying for their children’s educations, buying homes and starting businesses. Their investments also help to strengthen the global economy: support businesses small and large; finance infrastructure projects that connect and power cities; and facilitate innovations that drive progress.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">This mission would not be possible without our smartest investment – the one we make in our employees. It’s why we’re dedicated to creating an environment where our colleagues feel welcomed, valued and supported with networks, benefits and development opportunities to help them thrive.</p><br /><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">To learn more about BlackRock, please visit <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fcareers.blackrock.com%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858757460%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;6CXUoyh4Ub9im0GQOujEuZH8Rmf3O%2BLXRHCG8Lq4BLM%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Careers.BlackRock.com</u></span></a>. We also encourage you to get to know us on <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fblackrock&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858797423%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;F9%2BP2n8dtIohs%2BfyLRpV%2FXcW7F4NmY266WgISqxEJBk%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>LinkedIn</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url&#61;https%3A%2F%2Fwww.instagram.com%2Fblackrock%2F&amp;data&#61;05%7C02%7CPoulam.Maiti%40blackrock.com%7C8c001f38dc71438fe65308debd7ccca5%7C282a32955c424d939ec16631001cc5f7%7C0%7C0%7C639156540858827710%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata&#61;JbotoyYoorFoIKfwqJ3jMHDQ4GDxptOzl6DWG%2BmCDVA%3D&amp;reserved&#61;0\"><span style=\"color:#0875e1\"><u>Instagram</u></span></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://nam10.sa