{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:bah-bah-jobs:/job/McLean-VA/Financial-Analyst--Senior_R0246135","source":{"type":"workday","board":"bah-BAH_Jobs","job_id":"/job/McLean-VA/Financial-Analyst--Senior_R0246135","source_url":"https://bah.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/bah/BAH_Jobs/jobs","response_hash":"50dd570730fbab2fe6770c55b42010520dd19e4cc1b32968d036f2ce518db729","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"Booz Allen","slug":"booz-allen","lists":["consulting-ai","enterprise-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Financial Analyst, Senior","canonical_url":"https://bah.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BAH_Jobs/job/McLean-VA/Financial-Analyst--Senior_R0246135","apply_url":"https://bah.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BAH_Jobs/job/McLean-VA/Financial-Analyst--Senior_R0246135","locations":[{"label":"McLean, VA"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"unknown","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R0246135","internal_job_id":null,"first_published_at":null,"source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":null,"description_html":null,"compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":null,"country":null,"posted_on":"Posted 19 Days Ago"},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T06:16:39.881Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":false,"tier":"stretch","score":0,"level":"senior","term":null,"tracks":[],"role_matches":[],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":[],"exclude_matches":["Senior"],"configured_tracks":["consulting-ai","enterprise-ai"]}}
{"schema_version":1,"job_key":"workday:bah-bah-jobs:/job/Stuttgart-Baden-Wurttemberg/Financial-Data-Analyst_R0247424","source":{"type":"workday","board":"bah-BAH_Jobs","job_id":"/job/Stuttgart-Baden-Wurttemberg/Financial-Data-Analyst_R0247424","source_url":"https://bah.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/wday/cxs/bah/BAH_Jobs/jobs","response_hash":"7f970bc262b72dfc8d364ed00710cef1992fca2ac32b3293f3313ef6c71a174b","fetched_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z"},"company":{"name":"Booz Allen","slug":"booz-allen","lists":["consulting-ai","enterprise-ai"],"target_role":null,"fit_tier":null},"title":"Financial Data Scientist","canonical_url":"https://bah.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BAH_Jobs/job/Stuttgart-Baden-Wurttemberg/Financial-Data-Analyst_R0247424","apply_url":"https://bah.wd1.myworkdayjobs.com/BAH_Jobs/job/Stuttgart-Baden-Wurttemberg/Financial-Data-Analyst_R0247424","locations":[{"label":"Stuttgart, Baden-Wurttemberg"}],"workplace_type":"unknown","employment_type":"full_time","departments":[],"teams":[],"language":null,"requisition_id":"R0247424","internal_job_id":"ce7800f7d1461001693c3ece91590000","first_published_at":"2026-08-21","source_updated_at":null,"application_deadline":null,"description_plain":"Financial Data Scientist The Opportunity:\nAs a Finan cia l Data Analyst, you’ll bring your technical, analytical, and operational support expertise to work alongside thought leaders in data analytics, digital engineering, and finan cia l management on projects supporting operations across EUCOM and AFRICOM Areas of Responsibility. You’ll use your skills and expertise to integrate, analyze, and improve finan cia l data processes and systems that enable mission execution.\n\nWork with us to identify inefficiencies, improve fiscal data workflows, and deliver actionable insights that enhance decision-making, continuity, and operational effectiveness across complex defense finan cia l systems.\n\nThis position supports an essential finan cia l data environment and is structured to encompass two skill sets under one role. These include process and change management and program support, driving process improvement, supporting continuity, developing SOPs, helping stabilize and mature finan cia l workflows and reporting, data engineering, and technical analytics supporting data integration, transformation, and analysis across structured and unstructured finan cia l data sources and enabling scalable analytics and reporting. To be successful in this role, you should be comfortable operating in a collaborative environment.\n\nWhat You’ll Work On:\n- Lead or support change management efforts and workflow improvements.\n\n- Support continuity of operations by maintaining institutional knowledge, SOPs, and process documentation.\n\n- Support data validation, quality checks, and compliance-focused finan cia l analysis.\n\n- Collaborate with stakeholders to improve reporting processes and data usability.\n\n- Support data transformation, automation, and visualization efforts.\n\n- Integrate and analyze finan cia l data from multiple systems to ensure accuracy and completeness.\n\n- Compile, review, and format fiscal data extracts and reports for leadership awareness.\n\n- Identify trends, recurring issues, and process inefficiencies within finan cia l data workflows.\n\nJoin us. The world can’t wait.\n\nYou Have:\n- Experience with data exploration, data cleaning, data analysis, data visualization, or data mining\n\n- Experience working with structured and unstructured data sources\n\n- Knowledge of finan cia l data workflows, reporting processes, or fiscal data management\n\n- Ability to identify trends, inconsistencies, and process inefficiencies within datasets\n\n- Ability to communicate analytical findings clearly to technical and non-technical stakeholders\n\n- Secret clearance\n\n- Bachelor's degree\n\nNice If You Have:\n- Experience supporting Department of Defense ( DoD ) finan cia l systems, data platforms, or analytics environments\n\n- Experience with programming or scripting languages such as Python, R, or SQL for data analysis\n\n- Knowledge of data engineering concepts such as ETL pipelines, data integration, and automation\n\n- Knowledge of process improvement or change management met hodologies\n\n- Ability to develop dashboards or data visualizations with tools such as Power BI or Tableau\n\nClearance:\nApplicants selected will be subject to a security investigation and may need to meet eligibility requirements for access to classified information ; Secret clearance is required.\n\nCompensation\nAt Booz Allen, we celebrate your contributions, provide you with opportunities and choices, and support your total well-being. Our offerings include health, life, disability, financial, and retirement benefits, as well as paid leave, professional development, tuition assistance, work-life programs, and dependent care. Our recognition awards program acknowledges employees for exceptional performance and superior demonstration of our values. Full-time and part-time employees working at least 20 hours a week on a regular basis are eligible to participate in Booz Allen’s benefit programs. Individuals that do not meet the threshold are only eligible for select offerings, not inclusive of health benefits. We encourage you to learn more about our total benefits by visiting the Resource page on our Careers site and reviewing Our Employee Benefits page.\n\nSalary at Booz Allen is determined by various factors, including but not limited to location, the individual’s particular combination of education, knowledge, skills, competencies, and experience, as well as contract-specific affordability and organizational requirements. The projected compensation range for this position is $99,000.00 to $225,000.00 (annualized USD). The estimate displayed represents the typical salary range for this position and is just one component of Booz Allen’s total compensation package for employees. This posting will close within 90 days from the Posting Date.\nIdentity Statement\nAs part of the hiring process, we will ask you to complete an identity verification process that leverages advanced biometrics and artificial intelligence to ensure authenticity and protect against identity fraud. You are expected to be on camera during interviews and assessments. We reserve the right to take your picture to verify your identity and prevent fraud.\n\nCandidate AI Usage Policy\nAI is a part of our daily work at Booz Allen, and we are committed to the responsible and ethical use of AI tools. However, we want to ensure a fair candidate process based on your own skills and knowledge. As part of this commitment, the use of artificial intelligence (AI) or other tools to assist with responses during interviews (whether in-person or virtual) is prohibited unless permission is explicitly provided .\n\nWork Model\nOur people-first culture prioritizes the benefits of collaboration, whether it occurs in person or virtually. To support engagement and effective communication, employees working virtually are generally expected to have their cameras on during meetings.\n- Remote : If this position is listed as remote, there may still be occasions when you are required to work in person at a Booz Allen or customer facility.\n\n- Hybrid : If this position is listed as hybrid, you will be expected to work from a Booz Allen facility frequently, in alignment with leadership expectations and the needs of the role. You may also be required to work from or visit a customer facility.\n\n- Onsite : If this position is listed as onsite, work will primarily be performed at a Booz Allen office or customer facility, where employees will collaborate directly with colleagues and customers as required by the role.\n\nCommitment to Non-Discrimination\nAll qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to disability, status as a protected veteran or any other status protected by applicable federal, state, local, or international law.","description_html":"Financial Data Scientist<p><b><span>The Opportunity:</span></b></p><p>As a Finan<span>cia</span>l Data Analyst, you’ll bring your technical, analytical, and operational support expertise to work alongside thought leaders in data analytics, digital engineering, and finan<span>cia</span>l management on projects supporting operations across EUCOM and AFRICOM Areas of Responsibility. You’ll use your skills and expertise to integrate, analyze, and improve finan<span>cia</span>l data processes and systems that enable mission execution.</p><p></p><p>Work with us to identify inefficiencies, improve fiscal data workflows, and deliver actionable insights that enhance decision-making, continuity, and operational effectiveness across complex defense finan<span>cia</span>l systems.</p><p></p><p>This position supports an essential finan<span>cia</span>l data environment and is structured to encompass two skill sets under one role. These include process and change management and program support, driving process improvement, supporting continuity, developing SOPs, helping stabilize and mature finan<span>cia</span>l workflows and reporting, data engineering, and technical analytics supporting data integration, transformation, and analysis across structured and unstructured finan<span>cia</span>l data sources and enabling scalable analytics and reporting. To be successful in this role, you should be comfortable operating in a collaborative environment.</p><p></p><p><b>What You’ll Work On:</b></p><ul><li><p>Lead or support change management efforts and workflow improvements.</p></li><li><p>Support continuity of operations by maintaining institutional knowledge, SOPs, and process documentation.</p></li><li><p>Support data validation, quality checks, and compliance-focused finan<span>cia</span>l analysis.</p></li><li><p>Collaborate with stakeholders to improve reporting processes and data usability.</p></li><li><p>Support data transformation, automation, and visualization efforts.</p></li><li><p>Integrate and analyze finan<span>cia</span>l data from multiple systems to ensure accuracy and completeness.</p></li><li><p>Compile, review, and format fiscal data extracts and reports for leadership awareness.</p></li><li><p>Identify trends, recurring issues, and process inefficiencies within finan<span>cia</span>l data workflows.</p></li></ul><p></p><p>Join us. The world can’t wait.</p><p></p><p><b><span>You Have:</span></b></p><ul><li><p><span>Experience</span> with data exploration, data cleaning, data analysis, data visualization, or data mining</p></li><li><p><span>Experience</span> working with structured and unstructured data sources</p></li><li><p><span>Knowledge of</span> finan<span>cia</span>l data workflows, reporting processes, or fiscal data management</p></li><li><p><span>Ability to</span> identify trends, inconsistencies, and process inefficiencies within datasets</p></li><li><p><span>Ability to</span> communicate analytical findings clearly to technical and non-technical stakeholders</p></li><li><p><span>Secret clearance</span></p></li><li><p><span>Bachelor&#39;s degree</span></p></li></ul><p></p><p><b><span>Nice If You Have:</span></b></p><ul><li><p><span>Experience</span> supporting Department of Defense <span>(</span>DoD<span>)</span> finan<span>cia</span>l systems, data platforms, or analytics environments</p></li><li><p><span>Experience</span> with programming or scripting languages such as Python, R, or SQL for data analysis</p></li><li><p><span>Knowledge of</span> data engineering concepts such as ETL pipelines, data integration, and automation</p></li><li><p><span>Knowledge of</span> process improvement or change management <span>met</span>hodologies</p></li><li><p><span>Ability to</span> develop dashboards or data visualizations with tools such as Power BI or Tableau</p></li></ul><p></p><p><b><span>Clearance:</span></b></p><p><span>Applicants selected will be subject to a security investigation and may need to meet eligibility requirements for access to classified information</span><span>;</span> <span>Secret clearance is required.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><b>Compensation</b></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">At Booz Allen, we celebrate your contributions, provide you with opportunities and choices, and support your total well-being. Our offerings include health, life, disability, financial, and retirement benefits, as well as paid leave, professional development, tuition assistance, work-life programs, and dependent care. Our recognition awards program acknowledges employees for exceptional performance and superior demonstration of our values. Full-time and part-time employees working at least 20 hours a week on a regular basis are eligible to participate in Booz Allen’s benefit programs. Individuals that do not meet the threshold are only eligible for select offerings, not inclusive of health benefits. We encourage you to learn more about our total benefits by visiting the Resource page on our Careers site and reviewing Our Employee Benefits page.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p>Salary at Booz Allen is determined by various factors, including but not limited to location, the individual’s particular combination of education, knowledge, skills, competencies, and experience, as well as contract-specific affordability and organizational requirements. The projected compensation range for this position is $99,000.00 to $225,000.00 (annualized USD). The estimate displayed represents the typical salary range for this position and is just one component of Booz Allen’s total compensation package for employees. This posting will close within 90 days from the Posting Date.<p style=\"text-align:inherit !important\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>Identity Statement</b></p><p style=\"text-align:left !important\">As part of the hiring process, we will ask you to complete an identity verification process that leverages advanced biometrics and artificial intelligence to ensure authenticity and protect against identity fraud. You are expected to be on camera during interviews and assessments. We reserve the right to take your picture to verify your identity and prevent fraud.</p><p></p><p><b>Candidate AI Usage Policy</b></p><p>AI is a part of our daily work at Booz Allen, and we are committed to the responsible and ethical use of AI tools. However, we want to ensure a fair candidate process based on <b>your </b>own skills and knowledge. As part of this commitment, the use of artificial intelligence (AI) or other tools to assist with responses during interviews (whether in-person or virtual) is prohibited <b>unless permission is explicitly provided</b>. </p><p style=\"text-align:inherit !important\"></p><p style=\"text-align:left !important\"><b>Work Model</b><br />Our people-first culture prioritizes the benefits of collaboration, whether it occurs in person or virtually. To support engagement and effective communication, employees working virtually are generally expected to have their cameras on during meetings.</p><ul><li><p><b>Remote</b>: If this position is listed as remote, there may still be occasions when you are required to work in person at a Booz Allen or customer facility.</p></li><li><p><b>Hybrid</b>: If this position is listed as hybrid, you will be expected to work from a Booz Allen facility frequently, in alignment with leadership expectations and the needs of the role. You may also be required to work from or visit a customer facility.</p></li><li><p><b>Onsite</b>: If this position is listed as onsite, work will primarily be performed at a Booz Allen office or customer facility, where employees will collaborate directly with colleagues and customers as required by the role.</p></li></ul><p></p><p><b>Commitment to Non-Discrimination</b></p><p>All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to disability, status as a protected veteran or any other status protected by applicable federal, state, local, or international law.</p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p><p style=\"text-align:inherit\"></p>","compensation":[],"custom_fields":{"can_apply":true,"country":{"descriptor":"Germany","id":"dcc5b7608d8644b3a93716604e78e995"},"posted_on":"Posted 3 Days Ago"},"status":"open","first_seen_at":"2026-08-20T06:16:39.881Z","last_seen_at":"2026-08-25T02:30:45.417Z","closed_at":null,"possibly_closed_at":null,"missing_complete_scans":0,"data_quality":null,"classification":{"included":true,"tier":"stretch","score":2,"level":"unspecified","term":null,"tracks":["data"],"role_matches":["Data Scientist"],"early_career_matches":[],"positive_matches":[],"exclude_matches":[],"configured_tracks":["consulting-ai","enterprise-ai"]}}
